# TypeScript

- Strict mode via root `tsconfig.json`; packages extend it.
- Prefer workspace packages (`@warden/*`) over deep relative paths across package roots.
- Declare every `@warden/*` import in the consuming `package.json`.
- Do not bump unrelated dependency versions during refactors.
- Run `npm run typecheck` before claiming TS work is done.
